Hello Everyone, My name is Domingo Gutierrez Ramos. Representing JAG Fremont high school.

Thanks to everyone's support during my campaign, I am honored to stand here today.
This is a huge step for me, and how much JAG has helped me along the way. I used to be so nervous to talk to people and it stunted my growth. My old school environment made me feel unwelcome and disconnected, either for the way I talked, dressed, or walked. Crazy right? Well I managed to push on through with this and fight back without words or fists but by influencing others to improve the way they act, whether discouraging misbehavior in a teacher's absence or setting myself as an example for people to follow and learn from. 
To change is to adapt and improve, to improve is to innovate.
I am very good at making allies and stopping conflict by the root of the issue. This is how I solve most things whether it be in my classes or in my own hobbies like programming. Dedication to problem solving is what I bring to the table. 

The Presidency campaign further helped me, by getting out of my comfort zone to film outside, to look deeper into myself and ask, is this what i want? And yes, this is all I ever wanted. JAG has helped me try things that I have never done before, i dont like everything but i try to be open. I work to implement things from JAG to my own life by thinking deeper about what I want and how I am to achieve these goals. Last year I wanted to get into basketball but never really had the courage. This campaign / election has helped bring out myself to overcome fears and to embrace change. I know not everyone is up to it, but I want to shine this focus onto others, by dedicating time to tangible goals. And working on improving the way we view JAG. My vision for this role is to further push out opportunities for students to connect with and develop skills that they can use in their own lives and in their future careers,  JAG has already helped many students by making them use critical thinking to solve issues together, and finding their own solutions to the same problems, JAG is truly unlike any other class. And I want more people to join and experience what it has to offer. I hope to lead people with unity and purpose. I will apply my own unique skills and focus , and my passion for projects to execute and serve every student in this state, Nebraska. Thank You.
